  "title": "Jamo Gang “All Eyes On Us”",
  "htmlContent": "&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-111326 aligncenter\" src=\"http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Jamo-Gang-EP-front-cover-2-1-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\n\nAhead of the release of Jamo Gang’s self-titled EP, the group (MCs El Gant and Ras Kass and producer J57) have shared the first escape from the project; which was premiered today by HipHopDX. Entitled “All Eyes On Us,” the track comes with an explosive feature from Brown Bag All-Stars’ DeeJay Element.\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The<em> <strong>Jamo Gang</strong></em> EP is expected to arrive on <span data-term=\"goog_500878735\">1-30-18</span> and comes with a bonus track from <a href=\"http://hiphopdx.com/videos/id.25891/title.dxclusive-find-out-why-dj-premier-co-signed-jamo-gang-ras-kass-el-gant-j57\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://hiphopdx.com/videos/id.25891/title.dxclusive-find-out-why-dj-premier-co-signed-jamo-gang-ras-kass-el-gant-j57&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1515555520921000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFu5IDr3pWAWjL7z84LhdEYTO62Yg\">DJ Premier</a> who originally co-signed the East Coast trio.</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check out “All Eyes On Us” and the EP’s tracklist.</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cuts by Deejay Element</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Extra Vocals: Ms Bodega &amp; Akie Bermiss</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Purchase &amp; Stream at Apple Music:  <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/album/all-eyes-on-us-feat-deejay-element-single/1332507659?ls=1\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://itunes.apple.com/us/album/all-eyes-on-us-feat-deejay-element-single/1332507659?ls%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1515555520921000&amp;usg=AFQjCNH_mTikHWfDk_F_x-2vlyFzM-NKtQ\">https://itunes.apple.com/us/album/all-eyes-on-us-feat-deejay-element-single/1332507659?ls=1</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong><u>The ‘Jamo Gang’ EP Tracklisting With Credits:</u></strong></p>\n\n<ol style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n \t<li>‘This is Jamo Gang’</li>\n \t<li>‘Go Away’</li>\n \t<li>‘Straight No Chase’</li>\n \t<li>‘Here We Go Again’ feat. Big Twins</li>\n \t<li>‘All Eyes on Us’ feat. DeeJay Element</li>\n \t<li>‘Welcome to the Golden Era’</li>\n \t<li>‘Jamo Gang’ feat. Shabaam Sahdeeq</li>\n \t<li>‘The Altar’ feat. Snak the Ripper</li>\n</ol>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><strong>For More Information</strong>:</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/RasKass\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://twitter.com/RasKass&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1515555520921000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGA8FhR-gko2ASfELyCHnY-lodrZg\">https://twitter.com/RasKass</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ElGant\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://twitter.com/ElGant&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1515555520921000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEf3cGbxLpIwQGK0yamt9etqMNJ6A\">https://twitter.com/ElGant</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/j57\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://twitter.com/j57&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1515555520921000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGLXRuAY9vMQUUiXeXs8ewepXSbxw\">https://twitter.com/j57</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jamogang/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.instagram.com/jamogang/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1515555520921000&amp;usg=AFQjCNF1yzH9xapFax91NtaQZS2MI5CBzg\">https://www.instagram.com/jamogang/</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ras_kass/\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.instagram.com/ras_kass/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1515555520921000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHqIrBxgRo6b6xAduG6uro1RFRomA\">https://www.instagram.com/ras_kass/</a></p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<iframe style=\"border: 0; width: 100%; height: 120px;\" src=\"https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/track=269096860/size=large/bgcol=ffffff/linkcol=0687f5/tracklist=false/artwork=small/transparent=true/\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" seamless=\"\"><a href=\"http://jamogang.bandcamp.com/track/all-eyes-on-us-feat-deejay-element-prod-by-j57\">All Eyes on Us feat. DeeJay Element (Prod. by J57) by Jamo Gang</a></iframe>",
